type: software
title: >-
  Exact Symmetry-Stratified Search for Fast Matrix Multiplication over F2:
  A Second Inequivalent Rank-47 Scheme for 4x4, Rigidity Theorems, and
  Large Same-Rank Families at 5x5 and 6x6
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/big-brain-zaru/FastMatrixF2"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22823114"
